                <run fontcolor='#000000'>Æ </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>Operational efficiency metric showing how many pounds of SCG are diverted per mile of travel. Higher values indicate better route productivity. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
